Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For centuries, the enigmatic truth behind A ninja named Kaito freezing raindrops in mid air and battling dark shadow shinobi in the rain has baffled the greatest explorers and thinkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It all started in a time when early observations defied every conventional understanding of reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysterious anomalies were documented, recording sudden events that left behind no trace or explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Investigators arrived with cutting-edge equipment, desperately searching for rational scientific answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep beneath the surface, strange atmospheric signals began appearing on modern monitoring instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,While some experts blamed natural environmental extremes, others pointed toward far more mysterious forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Recent satellite scans finally revealed unexpected structural patterns buried in the uncharted depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Photographic evidence collected from the expedition shocked the international scientific community.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, leading researchers fiercely debate what these groundbreaking discoveries actually mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One undeniable fact remains: A ninja named Kaito freezing raindrops in mid air and battling dark shadow shinobi in the rain continues to challenge our perception of the modern world.
